arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-oneplus: cameras

The camera subsystem node (this tree's sdm845.dtsi has none), the camera I2C controller (CCI, until now
disabled), the three sensors with their regulators, reset GPIOs, MCLKs and pin states, and the two lens
actuators, from the sdm845-mainline tree, in a new sdm845-oneplus-camera.dtsi that
sdm845-oneplus-common.dtsi includes. LVS1 (the sensors' 1.8 V I/O and the CCI level shifter) is added to
this tree's PM8998 regulators. dt-bindings/media/video-interfaces.h (bus types) is added.
Wiring: CSIPHY0 <- IMX519 (C-PHY, 3 trios, CCI0 0x1a), CSIPHY1 <- IMX376K (D-PHY, 4 lanes, CCI1 0x10),
CSIPHY2 <- IMX371 (D-PHY, 4 lanes, CCI0 0x10). Compared with the previous DTB only nodes are added, and
the CCI node is enabled.

